## [X11CTX]
env: java.runtime.version=25.0.4.1+1-LTS java.vendor=Microsoft java.home=/Users/kibong_home/Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/ms-25.0.4.1/Contents/Home
10:07:02.979 [main] INFO org.springframework.security.core.SpringSecurityCoreVersion -- You are running with Spring Security Core 7.1.1
env: kotlin=2.3.21 spring-framework=7.0.9 spring-boot=4.1.1 spring-security=7.1.1 tomcat=11.0.24.0
ERROR dispatch 인가 허용 없음(exc.sec.error-permit=false), httpBasic user/pw(ROLE_USER). /x11/admin 은 hasRole('ADMIN').
probe: before-security(order -110) / after-security(order -50), REQUEST·ERROR 로 등록. attr = 요청 속성의 SecurityContext

### exc.sec.drop-ctx-attr=false
SecurityContextHolderFilter.securityContextRepository = DelegatingSecurityContextRepository[HttpSessionSecurityContextRepository, RequestAttributeSecurityContextRepository]
BasicAuthenticationFilter.securityContextRepository = RequestAttributeSecurityContextRepository
BasicAuthenticationFilter is OncePerRequestFilter = true, shouldNotFilterErrorDispatch() = true
AuthorizationFilter.filterErrorDispatch = true
| case | status | content-type | WWW-Authenticate | body |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| (1) anonymous GET /x2/ise | 401 | - | Basic realm="Realm", charset="UTF-8" |  |
  dispatch: [REQUEST /x2/ise, ERROR /error]
  probe: before-security REQUEST /x2/ise attr=absent holder=null
  probe: before-security ERROR /error attr=absent holder=null
| (1b) user GET /x11/admin | 403 | application/json | - | {"timestamp":"2026-10-08T01:07:04.362Z","status":403,"error":"Forbidden","path":"/x11/admin"} |
  dispatch: [REQUEST /x11/admin, ERROR /error]
  probe: before-security REQUEST /x11/admin attr=absent holder=null
  probe: before-security ERROR /error attr=UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(user) holder=null
  probe: after-security ERROR /error attr=UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(user) holder=UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(user)

### exc.sec.drop-ctx-attr=true  (ERROR dispatch 가 Security 에 들어가기 전에 요청 속성의 SecurityContext 를 지운다)
| case | status | content-type | WWW-Authenticate | body |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| (1) anonymous GET /x2/ise | 401 | - | Basic realm="Realm", charset="UTF-8" |  |
  dispatch: [REQUEST /x2/ise, ERROR /error]
  probe: before-security REQUEST /x2/ise attr=absent holder=null
  probe: before-security ERROR /error attr=absent holder=null
| (1b) user GET /x11/admin | 401 | - | Basic realm="Realm", charset="UTF-8" |  |
  dispatch: [REQUEST /x11/admin, ERROR /error]
  probe: before-security REQUEST /x11/admin attr=absent holder=null
  probe: before-security ERROR /error attr=UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(user) holder=null
  probe: before-security ERROR removed attr

